hopeless: the launch is declined as the driver's out-of-memory refusal, with no device writes: true
hopeless: refused once, without a retry: true
hopeless: the context then runs a small-frame kernel correctly: true
bound: an s11d_ref-sized frame (48 KiB for one thread) computes the right values: true
bound: the device's free memory after its launch is within half its reservation of before it: true
bound: its launch released the reservation once, and a small frame's none: true
bound: a frame reserving a quarter more than the reset threshold resets, one a quarter less does not: true
graph: the two-segment routine runs as a captured graph: true
graph: it computes the right values: true
graph: the free memory after the graph launch is within half the reservation of before it, released once: true
graph: a hopeless frame in a graph is refused at its instantiation, then as its plain launch, and declined as the driver's out-of-memory refusal, without a retry: true
hip: a scratch frame for one work-item computes the right values: true
hip: the backend reports the launch back-off's counters, and it was not needed: true
